></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/30_1385460146a630aaccf08b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/31_20616234346a630ab0531a5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/32_259608906a630ab41e299.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/33_5767930936a630ab7ae8c5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/34_3769751276a630abb17832.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/35_17941475146a630abe29e6a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/36_18324319156a630ac1339b3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/37_13733174136a630ac451667.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/38_1285377426a630ac76f471.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/39_17313194566a630aca96021.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/40_21362491036a630acdf09d5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/41_2355673356a630ad177aaf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/42_19473762776a630ad51e16a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/43_3680551376a630ad893eef.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/44_12101310136a630adbb1b7d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/45_10939889746a630adf5e00d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/46_17600995206a630ae2a1c37.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/47_1824772426a630ae600a05.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/48_491711176a630ae99259e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/49_1873941396a630aed2052d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/50_447249096a630af030dec.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : tvb即時資訊 喊戲 游嘉欣 非份之罪</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Jul 24 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T08:21:06.610334+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1214,"images":55,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}